@startuml 01-use-case-current-poc
!include _style.puml

title ClassLink Current POC — Use Case Diagram
caption Current POC — client-side BLE proof of concept only

left to right direction

actor Teacher
actor Student

rectangle "ClassLink BLE Attendance POC" {

  rectangle "Teacher actions" {
    usecase "Start Session" as UC_Start
    usecase "Generate 6-Digit Code" as UC_GenCode #C8E6C9
    usecase "Start BLE Advertising" as UC_Advertise #C8E6C9
    usecase "Receive Student Check-In" as UC_Receive #C8E6C9
    usecase "Stop Session" as UC_Stop
    usecase "View Received Check-Ins" as UC_View
  }

  rectangle "Student actions" {
    usecase "Grant Bluetooth Permission" as UC_Perm #D5D8DC
    usecase "Start BLE Scan" as UC_Scan #C8E6C9
    usecase "Discover ClassLink Service" as UC_Discover #C8E6C9
    usecase "Read Session Code" as UC_ReadCode #C8E6C9
    usecase "Collect RSSI Samples" as UC_Collect #C8E6C9
    usecase "Calculate Median RSSI" as UC_Median #C8E6C9
    usecase "Enter Name and Roll Number" as UC_Enter
    usecase "Connect to Teacher Device" as UC_Connect #C8E6C9
    usecase "Send Check-In Payload" as UC_Send #C8E6C9
    usecase "View Check-In Result" as UC_Result
  }
}

Teacher -- UC_Start
Teacher -- UC_Stop
Teacher -- UC_View

Student -- UC_Perm
Student -- UC_Scan
Student -- UC_Enter
Student -- UC_Result

UC_Start ..> UC_GenCode : <<include>>
UC_Start ..> UC_Advertise : <<include>>
UC_Scan ..> UC_Discover : <<include>>
UC_Discover ..> UC_ReadCode : <<include>>
UC_Discover ..> UC_Collect : <<include>>
UC_Collect ..> UC_Median : <<include>>

UC_Median -[#1B3A63]-> UC_Send : requires successful\nRSSI validation
UC_Enter -[#1B3A63]-> UC_Connect
UC_Connect -[#1B3A63]-> UC_Send
UC_Send -[#1B3A63]-> UC_Receive : follows
UC_Receive -[#1B3A63]-> UC_View

note bottom of UC_Send
  This diagram shows only features implemented in the BLE proof
  of concept. Backend authentication, database storage, device
  binding and biometrics are future work.
end note

legend right
  |= Color |= Meaning |
  | <back:#AED6F1>    </back> | Flutter app action |
  | <back:#C8E6C9>    </back> | BLE operation |
  | <back:#D5D8DC>    </back> | Platform permission API |
endlegend

@enduml
